我透露给你点秘密。
I thought I'd give you a few tips.

396
00:18:39,870 --> 00:18:41,780
你从没有帮过迈克。
You never helped Mike?!

397
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:44,640
瞧迈克挨整挺有意思。
Seeing him squirm is fun.

398
00:18:45,780 --> 00:18:46,960
你看上去就像个可怜的小动物在挣扎。
Seeing you suffer is like seeing Merve Griffindon sing.

399
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:50,720
谢谢你。
