400
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,600
你首先得知道，
First thing you have to know,

401
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:56,690
咱们干了任何坏事，他们都会怪自己不好。
is that parents blame themselves for every bad thing we do.

402
