409
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:25,920
Carol说得对，他鼻子是在出大气。
Carol was right, you were breathing through your nose.

410
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,780
Ben，我想……
Ben, I have....

411
00:19:33,780 --> 00:19:34,640
爸爸，我原先并不知道，
Dad, I didn't know any better,

412
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:37,600
我，再也不听摇滚乐了。
and I'm through with rock and roll.

413
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:39,500
好过点了吗？
Better?

414
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:40,360
不。
No!

415
00:19:41,340 --> 00:19:41,720
太失望了。
Nuts.

416
00:19:42,580 --> 00:19:44,220
如果你老实一点，
Ben this is gonna go a lot faster

417
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:45,190
这个谈话也许可以轻松得多。
if you'll just be straight with me. Ok?

418
00:19:45,190 --> 00:19:46,280
可以。
Ok.

419
00:19:46,620 --> 00:19:47,540
电话号码哪来的？
Where did you get the number?

420
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:50,160
公园树上的传单上。
From a poster on a tree in the park

421
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:51,380
是大孩子们张贴的。
where the big kids hang out.

422
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:52,380
是真话吗？
That's the truth?

423
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,280
对。谈完了吗？
Yes. Are we done?

424
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:55,280
没有。我要让你知道。
No. I'll let you know.

425
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:58,360
你明不明白你是在听一些
Did you know that what you were listening to,

426
