你干嘛到处传号码？
Well then, why did you pass it out?

436
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:13,190
我到处传？
Are you kidding?

437
00:20:13,190 --> 00:20:15,450
有人说我有号码，
Word spread I had the number,

438
00:20:16,020 --> 00:20:17,440
