and kids were all over me!

439
00:20:17,820 --> 00:20:19,280
就连大孩子也来了。
Even big kids!

440
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:22,240
我再也不是迈克的小弟弟了，
For once I wasn't Mike's little brother,

441
00:20:22,520 --> 00:20:24,660
我成了大红人Ben了。
I was Ben, the good time guy.

442
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:28,120
这算是出风头，Ben。
That's a dubious distinction Ben.

443
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:30,300
对，可挺带劲。
Yeah, it was great.

444
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,050
Ben，要是你对性的问题感到好奇
Look if you're curious about sex

445
