孩子，咱们可以谈谈性的问题。
Well, we have to talk about sex here.

450
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:48,080
难道我听的还不够吗？
Haven't I heard enough about that?

451
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:52,160
可是你并没有听到正确的，
Well you haven't heard anything that's right,

452
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:54,740
