Yeah.

456
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,980
对。
Sex is a beautiful thing.

457
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:07,420
应该说性是一种非常美好的东西，
It's a private thing that two people share

458
00:21:07,420 --> 00:21:08,900
是属于两个人之间的一种私事。
when they care about each other.

459
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:13,440
绝不是指一个人和公共用品之间的事。
It's not between one person and a public utility.

460
00:21:17,750 --> 00:21:23,960
(Back to present time)

461
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:26,740
你对他说这些话了？
You actually told him that?

462
00:21:26,820 --> 00:21:28,300
对，差不多是那样。
More or less, yeah.

463
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:31,500
当我写下你对我说的这些话时，
That's when you told me to write all this stuff down.

464
00:21:31,660 --> 00:21:32,860
我学到了不少东西，
I learnt a lot from this.

465
00:21:33,280 --> 00:21:35,980
我懂得了不该用性问题为自己扬名，
I know that sex isn't something you use to make you famous.

466
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:39,120
我也懂得了不该打那些电话。
And I know that I never should have made those calls,

467
00:21:39,120 --> 00:21:40,720
我会用自己的钱付帐。
and I'll pay you for them somehow.

468
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:43,280
我唯一还不明白的就是，
The one thing I still don't get,

469
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:45,780
既然这类下流货色不该让我这样的人听见，
is since I shouldn't hear junk like that,

470
00:21:46,080 --> 00:21:49,500
那为什么这种号码竟会连小孩也能搞到？
how come it's so easy for a little kid like me to get the number?

471
00:21:57,660 --> 00:21:59,290
真遗憾
Alright, I'm sorry!

