我看应该好好教训他。
Now he has got to be punished.

479
00:22:15,260 --> 00:22:17,020
你们应该硬起心肠来惩罚他一下。
You know, I think it's time you guys took a firmer hand with him....

480
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:18,580
你提醒得好。说到惩罚，
Speaking of punishment,

481
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:21,900
你旷课去柯尼岛的那笔账还跟你算呢！
there's still that little matter of you cutting school to go to Coney Island.

482
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:26,140
可我想靠惩罚也解决不了问题，
On the other hand, what good does punishment really do?

483
00:22:27,260 --> 00:22:29,900
